WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 27=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.760 --> 01:42.760
The ceremony is complete.

01:42.959 --> 01:44.640
Lead the way with lanterns.

01:44.640 --> 01:46.840
Go forth to welcome the bride.

01:46.840 --> 01:49.940
(Upholding the Virtue
of Generations Past)

01:50.420 --> 01:52.660
(Glorify the Family Name)

03:16.140 --> 03:19.180
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

03:20.220 --> 03:23.260
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

03:24.220 --> 03:28.100
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

03:28.740 --> 03:31.580
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

03:32.960 --> 03:34.639
Go to your husband's home.

03:35.840 --> 03:37.520
Let obedience be your guiding principle.

03:39.319 --> 03:41.199
Never forget to
be solemn and respectful.

03:45.910 --> 03:46.744
Be ever respectful

03:47.400 --> 03:48.240
and ever mindful.

03:50.319 --> 03:52.159
Do not disobey your parents-in-law.

03:52.159 --> 03:54.500
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

03:55.180 --> 03:58.620
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

04:01.560 --> 04:02.479
Father.

04:04.800 --> 04:05.639
Mother.

04:09.840 --> 04:11.159
While I'm away,

04:12.800 --> 04:14.319
please take good care of yourselves.

04:16.020 --> 04:20.340
♪The journey home
is always filled with joy and sorrow♪

04:20.340 --> 04:24.660
♪People gather, then part♪

04:25.780 --> 04:29.540
♪Regret is writing,
"I hope this letter finds you well"♪

04:30.620 --> 04:33.820
♪Yet watching their figures grow frail♪

04:34.860 --> 04:38.900
♪In my hometown,
leaves fall upon the gray roof tiles♪

04:38.900 --> 04:43.180
♪Leaving only a small house behind♪

04:56.980 --> 05:01.060
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

05:01.460 --> 05:05.060
♪Snow covers the eaves once more♪

05:05.199 --> 05:06.800
The groom has arrived.

05:06.959 --> 05:10.199
Please have the bride
enter the bridal sedan.

05:10.399 --> 05:13.360
The groom has arrived. Please have
the bride enter the bridal sedan!

05:13.624 --> 05:14.830
Get into the bridal sedan!

05:14.839 --> 05:17.800
Please have the bride come out
and enter the bridal sedan!

05:20.319 --> 05:21.959
The groom has arrived!

05:22.079 --> 05:25.199
Please have the bride
enter the bridal sedan!

05:26.660 --> 05:30.500
♪Say we'll meet again in our dreams♪

05:57.279 --> 05:58.199
The groom has arrived.

05:58.399 --> 06:01.480
Please have the bride
enter the bridal sedan.

06:09.360 --> 06:12.240
The groom has arrived. Please have
the bride enter the bridal sedan.

06:25.620 --> 06:28.180
(The Joyous Union
of the Lin and Xu Families)

06:42.420 --> 06:53.380
(Double Happiness)

07:19.340 --> 07:23.759
(Lu Family Painting
and Calligraphy Shop)

07:23.759 --> 07:26.199
I pay my respects to you,
Father and Mother.

07:27.959 --> 07:28.759
Young...

07:36.040 --> 07:38.160
By the Emperor's command,

07:38.920 --> 07:41.240
I give my daughter to you as your wife.

07:42.319 --> 07:44.160
May the two of you,
from this day forward,

07:46.319 --> 07:47.959
live together in perfect harmony,

07:49.959 --> 07:51.439
and enjoy peaceful years together.

07:53.000 --> 07:56.240
Do not fail to honor
the Emperor's gracious intent,

07:58.160 --> 08:00.480
nor cause your parents sorrow.

08:10.120 --> 08:12.439
I will remember your counsel, Father.

08:13.079 --> 08:14.639
I will never cause our elders sorrow

08:15.000 --> 08:16.279
or disappoint His Majesty.

08:29.439 --> 08:34.600
The auspicious hour has arrived. Please
have the bride enter the bridal sedan.

08:52.679 --> 08:53.399
Careful.

08:57.000 --> 08:58.840
- Good!
- Good!

09:00.780 --> 09:03.799
(The Joyous Union
of the Lin and Xu Families)

09:03.799 --> 09:04.919
Steady the sedan.

09:38.799 --> 09:40.000
Lift the sedan.

09:59.559 --> 10:01.200
Raise the sedan.

10:03.240 --> 10:03.919
Let's go!

10:19.600 --> 10:21.600
Raise the sedan. Let's go!

10:49.900 --> 10:53.660
(The Joyous Union
of the Lin and Xu Families)

11:09.180 --> 11:11.100
(The Joyous Union
of the Lin and Xu Families)

11:17.240 --> 11:18.159
Make way!

11:24.080 --> 11:25.919
Can't you see we're escorting a bride?

11:25.992 --> 11:27.670
Don't make us miss the auspicious hour.

11:28.120 --> 11:28.799
Make way!

11:31.720 --> 11:32.679
Make way!

11:33.200 --> 11:36.519
We've been ordered to bring
the good news to Scholar Han's home.

11:38.200 --> 11:39.440
A wedding night

11:39.440 --> 11:41.032
may be one of life's great occasions,

11:41.240 --> 11:42.399
but throughout Jinling City,

11:42.399 --> 11:44.639
men get married every day.

11:45.279 --> 11:46.799
But to place first

11:47.519 --> 11:49.159
in the provincial examination

11:49.559 --> 11:51.679
is a distinction granted
to one in ten thousand.

11:51.679 --> 11:53.720
Exactly. One in ten thousand.

11:56.000 --> 11:59.759
Clearly, placing first in
the examination is the greater occasion.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.720
Sir, we'd appreciate your help.

12:03.240 --> 12:03.960
Please make way.

12:04.519 --> 12:07.000
- Please make way, Sir.
- Please make way, Sir.

12:09.360 --> 12:10.200
What's going on?

12:13.640 --> 12:16.550
The provincial examination was postponed
after the late Emperor's death.

12:16.550 --> 12:18.040
The results were only released today.

12:18.264 --> 12:20.840
We deliberately avoided
the area around the Confucius Temple,

12:21.480 --> 12:23.320
but despite all our planning,

12:23.799 --> 12:25.360
we never expected Scholar Han to pass,

12:26.120 --> 12:27.320
much less place first.

12:29.896 --> 12:31.864
The top provincial graduate,
Scholar Han?

12:32.919 --> 12:34.000
Yes, Scholar Han...

12:38.360 --> 12:39.399
What are we going to do?

12:39.679 --> 12:42.000
They're both major occasions.
Who should give way to whom?

13:01.559 --> 13:04.200
- Please make way, Sir.
- Please make way, Sir.

13:13.170 --> 13:14.568
We need to handle this carefully.

13:14.584 --> 13:16.750
Placing first in Jiangnan
is no ordinary distinction.

13:16.759 --> 13:18.360
He may well become a Hanlin bachelor

13:18.408 --> 13:20.264
and eventually
enter the Grand Secretariat.

13:21.559 --> 13:22.799
It's all your fault.

13:23.120 --> 13:25.352
If you had worked harder
and passed the examination,

13:25.360 --> 13:27.720
we would've gone to
the examination hall to see the results.

13:27.759 --> 13:30.759
Then we'd know
who placed first and where he lives.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.600
How... how is this my fault?

13:32.760 --> 13:34.056
Of course it's your fault.

13:45.816 --> 13:46.840
Lanxiang, don't worry.

13:46.888 --> 13:49.800
We've run into a procession bringing
news to the top provincial graduate.

13:50.039 --> 13:53.000
I hear his name is Han Liang,

13:53.064 --> 13:54.200
and he lives nearby, too.

13:54.200 --> 13:55.559
You could say you're neighbors.

13:55.759 --> 13:56.639
Don't worry.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.519
Don't be afraid, Lanxiang.

13:58.639 --> 14:01.200
I'm really good with my slingshot now.

14:01.480 --> 14:03.679
I won't let them disturb you.

14:10.279 --> 14:12.440
The top provincial graduate,
Scholar Han, is here!

14:16.440 --> 14:17.000
Han.

14:17.039 --> 14:17.600
Thank you.

14:17.600 --> 14:18.360
Scholar Han.

14:18.440 --> 14:19.159
Thank you.

14:19.320 --> 14:20.039
Scholar Han.

14:20.519 --> 14:21.080
Thank you.

14:21.519 --> 14:22.080
Thank you.

14:36.000 --> 14:36.960
He's so young.

14:38.080 --> 14:40.039
He doesn't look bookish at all.

14:40.279 --> 14:41.919
He has a promising future ahead of him.

14:42.159 --> 14:44.759
We mustn't offend him. We mustn't.

14:45.960 --> 14:47.240
I already have.

14:54.680 --> 14:57.800
Congratulations on placing first in
the provincial examination, Scholar Han.

14:58.080 --> 15:00.200
I also studied at Qixia Academy,

15:00.759 --> 15:03.200
so I know well that only
after ten years of diligent study

15:03.384 --> 15:05.440
could you earn a place
on the honor roll today.

15:06.840 --> 15:08.320
This is one of life's great joys,

15:08.344 --> 15:09.870
and I shouldn't spoil the occasion.

15:10.519 --> 15:11.159
But

15:12.039 --> 15:13.120
a smooth bridal procession

15:13.480 --> 15:15.039
is said to promise a smooth marriage.

15:16.559 --> 15:19.360
So I ask you and your fellow scholars

15:20.679 --> 15:21.480
to please make way.

15:22.000 --> 15:23.200
I heard the bride was a maid.

15:38.200 --> 15:39.879
I thought Commander Lin would say,

15:41.464 --> 15:42.960
"The Emperor bestowed this marriage,

15:44.080 --> 15:45.279
so I order you to make way."

15:46.840 --> 15:48.600
Had I not been truly sincere,

15:48.744 --> 15:51.528
I could never have obtained
the Emperor's decree for this marriage.

15:52.639 --> 15:53.919
So I hope, Scholar Han,

15:54.600 --> 15:57.000
you'll consider
the sincerity of my devotion

15:59.679 --> 16:01.279
and help another man fulfill his wish.

16:07.540 --> 16:11.780
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

16:11.780 --> 16:14.860
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

16:15.220 --> 16:18.740
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

16:20.360 --> 16:21.320
Thank you all

16:21.330 --> 16:23.656
for taking the trouble to come
and bring me the good news.

16:24.200 --> 16:25.519
My home is rather cramped,

16:25.520 --> 16:27.480
so I'm afraid I can't
properly receive you there.

16:28.480 --> 16:29.519
Scholar Zongbai

16:29.608 --> 16:30.870
has already reserved a banquet

16:30.936 --> 16:32.000
at Zuixian Restaurant.

16:32.799 --> 16:34.759
Please join us for a modest drink

16:36.279 --> 16:37.399
so we can celebrate together.

16:38.240 --> 16:39.279
- All right.
- All right.

16:41.600 --> 16:42.159
Let's go.

16:42.399 --> 16:44.039
Let's go celebrate
Scholar Han's success.

16:44.039 --> 16:46.320
- Come on, let's go celebrate!
- Let's go celebrate!

16:47.080 --> 16:49.639
- Congratulations, Scholar Han!
- Congratulations, Scholar Han!

16:50.159 --> 16:53.559
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

16:55.399 --> 16:57.440
What... Didn't you say
you'd already offended him?

16:57.559 --> 16:59.120
Didn't he make way for you right away?

17:01.559 --> 17:02.600
He didn't do it for me.

17:03.879 --> 17:04.319
Let's go.

17:06.359 --> 17:06.759
Wait.

17:07.799 --> 17:08.640
What was that about?

17:08.640 --> 17:09.440
I have no idea.

17:09.799 --> 17:11.160
All right, keep the music going.

17:25.350 --> 17:26.520
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

17:27.224 --> 17:28.690
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

17:34.660 --> 17:38.860
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

17:42.060 --> 17:46.260
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

17:49.440 --> 17:51.480
Bride, it's time
to step out of the sedan.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.640
Let's not miss the auspicious hour.

17:59.319 --> 17:59.920
Come.

18:05.559 --> 18:06.359
Careful.

18:07.960 --> 18:13.039
Bride and groom,
please hold the red ribbon.

18:17.200 --> 18:19.519
May peace bless every generation.

18:20.359 --> 18:22.799
- Good!
- Good!

18:23.640 --> 18:25.960
May the family line continue,

18:26.119 --> 18:28.720
with each generation
surpassing the last.

18:28.720 --> 18:31.820
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

18:32.300 --> 18:36.420
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

18:36.420 --> 18:39.580
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

18:39.580 --> 18:43.420
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

18:43.420 --> 18:46.220
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

18:46.220 --> 18:50.380
♪One last fire, one last cup of liquor♪

18:50.380 --> 18:53.340
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

18:55.960 --> 18:58.000
First bow to Heaven and Earth.

18:58.319 --> 19:02.799
- Good!
- Good!

19:03.680 --> 19:05.599
Second bow to your parents.

19:05.720 --> 19:10.200
- Good!
- Good!

19:13.279 --> 19:17.119
- Good!
- Good!

19:23.079 --> 19:25.680
Now bow to each other.

19:25.839 --> 19:29.359
- Good!
- Good!

19:44.759 --> 19:45.599
Lanxiang.

20:07.448 --> 20:09.880
- What's going on?
- Why haven't they performed the bow?

20:10.030 --> 20:10.648
That's right.

20:11.240 --> 20:12.079
What's happened?

20:23.200 --> 20:24.240
Bride.

20:27.359 --> 20:27.759
Come.

20:29.599 --> 20:30.359
Bride.

20:38.880 --> 20:41.680
- Good!
- Good!

20:45.279 --> 20:47.680
Escort the newlyweds
to the bridal chamber.

20:48.400 --> 20:49.480
Good!

20:49.480 --> 20:51.079
Let's have some fun with the newlyweds!

20:51.240 --> 20:52.840
Let's have some fun with the newlyweds!

20:52.888 --> 20:54.350
Have some fun with the newlyweds!

20:54.359 --> 20:56.160
- Good!
- Good!

21:00.000 --> 21:01.519
Wash up.

21:14.200 --> 21:20.799
Use the scale to lift the bridal veil
and reveal the bride's beautiful face.

21:21.240 --> 21:23.000
- Good!
- Good!

21:32.359 --> 21:33.279
What's the rush?

21:33.640 --> 21:35.880
It's Jinqi who gets
to lift the veil, not you.

21:37.319 --> 21:39.119
Tomorrow I'll tell Second Madam Lin

21:39.240 --> 21:41.359
it's time to find Jincen a wife.

21:43.279 --> 21:44.599
I don't want one!

21:48.759 --> 21:52.200
Groom, please lift the bridal veil.

21:52.920 --> 21:55.000
- Good!
- Good!

22:21.740 --> 22:28.140
(Lin)

22:40.740 --> 22:42.680
(Lin)

22:42.680 --> 22:44.759
- Good!
- Good!

22:59.000 --> 23:00.519
Today, we join our lives as one.

23:01.256 --> 23:03.240
May we be of one heart
and grow old together.

23:07.799 --> 23:10.039
- Good!
- Good!

23:22.440 --> 23:24.799
You've gone too far.

23:42.480 --> 23:42.839
No...

23:45.119 --> 23:45.920
Why did she hit him?

23:46.160 --> 23:46.759
I don't get it.

23:46.824 --> 23:47.480
What's going on?

23:47.880 --> 23:49.039
What happened?

23:49.039 --> 23:50.720
What's happening up front?

23:50.872 --> 23:52.820
We've seen the couple
share the ceremonial meal.

23:52.830 --> 23:53.976
Let's go have a drink.

23:54.319 --> 23:55.240
Shaohui.

23:55.240 --> 23:56.720
If you want a drink, go find Liu.

23:56.720 --> 23:58.279
I still want to see what happens next.

23:58.400 --> 23:59.960
Everyone, at tonight's wedding banquet,

24:00.000 --> 24:01.720
there's fine liquor
bestowed by His Majesty.

24:01.720 --> 24:03.272
If you don't go now, you'll miss out.

24:03.896 --> 24:05.656
Come on, let's go drink the fine liquor.

24:05.920 --> 24:07.279
Let's go.

24:07.816 --> 24:09.960
- Come on, let's go drink.
- Everyone, let's go.

24:10.759 --> 24:12.200
Let's go.

24:13.039 --> 24:14.640
Come on, let's go drink.

24:15.720 --> 24:16.240
Right.

24:16.680 --> 24:17.440
You may all leave.

24:17.559 --> 24:18.359
Go have a drink.

24:19.480 --> 24:20.440
Let's go.

24:20.960 --> 24:21.799
Go have a drink.

24:30.039 --> 24:30.799
All of you,

24:34.400 --> 24:35.960
keep your mouths shut about this.

24:37.400 --> 24:38.160
- Yes.
- Yes.

25:00.720 --> 25:01.960
I should have come to ask

25:03.039 --> 25:04.680
for your parents' consent

25:05.464 --> 25:07.368
before discussing marriage with you.

25:09.279 --> 25:10.400
I was at fault.

25:13.759 --> 25:15.039
Please forgive me, my lady.

25:32.660 --> 25:35.220
♪The golden sunset♪

25:35.220 --> 25:38.700
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

25:40.540 --> 25:43.060
♪All things fall silent♪

25:43.060 --> 25:46.420
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

25:47.100 --> 25:50.260
♪My restless heart
seeks a place to anchor♪

25:50.260 --> 25:53.780
♪Yet I cannot stop searching♪

25:54.540 --> 26:00.180
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

26:02.940 --> 26:06.380
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

26:06.380 --> 26:09.780
♪Lightly traced cause and effect♪

26:09.780 --> 26:10.820
(Lin)

26:10.820 --> 26:13.260
♪Half a lifetime of longing♪

26:13.260 --> 26:16.580
♪Returns to this moment♪

26:18.359 --> 26:19.519
If you're hungry...

26:20.900 --> 26:24.260
♪If the image isn't real,
what does it matter?♪

26:24.980 --> 26:30.300
♪I still remember your name♪

26:41.480 --> 26:42.839
Yuchan, Gantang, and the others

26:43.319 --> 26:44.519
are waiting outside.

26:46.079 --> 26:47.160
Whatever you want to eat

26:47.759 --> 26:48.680
or need,

26:49.240 --> 26:50.400
just tell them anytime.

26:54.119 --> 26:55.599
This is your home now.

26:56.920 --> 26:59.200
Make yourself comfortable.

27:02.860 --> 27:05.100
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

27:05.100 --> 27:10.060
♪For withholding its light♪

27:10.460 --> 27:13.780
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

27:14.200 --> 27:15.079
I'll go outside

27:15.720 --> 27:16.799
and see to the guests.

27:18.424 --> 27:19.830
I'll be back a little later.

27:22.260 --> 27:24.820
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

27:25.540 --> 27:29.580
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

27:29.580 --> 27:35.620
♪You and I will walk there together♪

27:58.232 --> 27:59.590
(Cry as hard as you can.)

28:00.880 --> 28:02.000
(Let it all out.)

28:03.768 --> 28:05.830
(Once we're done crying,
let's live our lives well.)

28:05.839 --> 28:08.820
♪Returns to this moment♪

28:09.759 --> 28:10.839
Live with all your might.

28:13.192 --> 28:14.240
Live as hard as you can.

28:16.440 --> 28:17.759
Live like wild grass,

28:20.799 --> 28:22.240
without a care in the world.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.599
From now on,

28:28.808 --> 28:30.310
(our days will know only spring,)

28:32.400 --> 28:33.440
(never winter.)

28:37.279 --> 28:39.039
(Let's live on without a care.)

28:39.340 --> 28:43.740
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

28:43.740 --> 28:46.700
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

28:46.700 --> 28:50.580
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

28:50.580 --> 28:54.620
♪You and I will walk there together♪

28:54.620 --> 28:57.860
♪I no longer search through old dreams♪

28:57.860 --> 29:00.940
♪Leaving them buried deep
within the years♪

29:02.020 --> 29:05.540
♪I only long to journey
through the night together♪

29:05.540 --> 29:09.140
♪Toward where my heart leads♪

29:09.820 --> 29:13.940
♪I no longer lament
that fate is hard to foresee♪

29:13.940 --> 29:17.060
♪Accepting the unexpected as ordinary♪

29:17.420 --> 29:21.020
♪I only wish the road
behind us would fade like mist♪

29:21.020 --> 29:26.700
♪And we would share the road home♪

29:40.519 --> 29:41.279
Good for her!

29:42.839 --> 29:43.839
He deserved it.

29:45.240 --> 29:46.759
That wretched boy deserved it.

29:49.680 --> 29:51.000
Is everything you just said true?

29:51.350 --> 29:52.456
Young Madam had no idea

29:52.488 --> 29:54.080
that Young Master wanted to marry her?

29:55.079 --> 29:56.119
If you don't believe me,

29:56.799 --> 29:57.720
you can send someone

29:57.920 --> 29:59.768
to ask Madam Tao,
the official matchmaker.

30:00.240 --> 30:01.240
Uncle Xu and Aunt Xu

30:02.200 --> 30:03.319
almost arranged her marriage

30:03.440 --> 30:05.319
to the Han family next door.

30:09.839 --> 30:12.000
Young Madam
certainly has a fierce temper.

30:13.160 --> 30:15.350
Even if Young Master forced her
into this marriage,

30:15.680 --> 30:17.480
a bride still shouldn't hit her groom.

30:18.680 --> 30:20.480
That wretched boy
went looking for a beating.

30:22.390 --> 30:23.656
He even went to all that trouble

30:23.660 --> 30:25.880
to obtain an imperial decree
just to get himself beaten.

30:26.480 --> 30:27.480
He deserved it.

30:29.656 --> 30:30.872
You! This is all your fault!

30:30.904 --> 30:32.750
You didn't try
to talk Young Master out of it!

30:32.759 --> 30:34.000
Mother, be reasonable!

30:34.000 --> 30:35.240
Please be reasonable!

30:35.400 --> 30:35.880
Young...

30:36.440 --> 30:38.559
Is Young Master
someone who listens to advice?

30:38.600 --> 30:40.888
Even so, you should've
tried to talk him out of it!

30:41.799 --> 30:42.720
Enough.

30:43.272 --> 30:45.144
Jiugao isn't the one
who deserves a beating.

30:52.160 --> 30:53.000
Get out of here.

30:58.680 --> 30:59.830
Go back to the banquet

31:00.392 --> 31:01.510
and attend to the guests.

31:04.440 --> 31:05.799
So we're just letting this go?

31:06.599 --> 31:07.720
If we don't,

31:08.500 --> 31:10.030
am I supposed to help that wretched boy

31:10.039 --> 31:11.359
by slapping the bride?

31:12.536 --> 31:14.000
Haven't we made enough of a spectacle

31:14.000 --> 31:15.079
of the Lin family already?

31:17.359 --> 31:18.680
With that wretched boy around,

31:18.856 --> 31:19.800
I think Jinling City

31:19.810 --> 31:22.376
will have enough to laugh about
for the next three to five years.

31:25.599 --> 31:27.319
First Madam, it's a joyous occasion.

31:27.319 --> 31:28.920
You can't hit him anymore. You can't!

31:30.000 --> 31:31.359
I'm not hitting my son.

31:31.390 --> 31:32.400
Surely you don't expect me

31:32.400 --> 31:34.490
to greet the guests
with a feather duster in my hand?

31:35.680 --> 31:37.000
I'm getting senile.

31:44.759 --> 31:46.039
That rotten boy.

31:46.599 --> 31:47.759
He's been the only one happy

31:47.759 --> 31:49.839
about this marriage
from beginning to end,

31:50.559 --> 31:51.359
yet he insists

31:51.359 --> 31:53.240
that all of us smile along with him.

31:53.920 --> 31:55.759
First Madam,
you're worrying too much.

31:56.559 --> 31:59.200
There are people who are
genuinely happy for Young Master.

31:59.496 --> 32:00.920
Of course they're genuinely happy

32:00.984 --> 32:02.550
when there's a spectacle to enjoy.

32:09.839 --> 32:11.240
Come. A toast to everyone.

32:13.680 --> 32:14.680
Congratulations!

32:14.799 --> 32:15.740
What took you so long?

32:15.750 --> 32:16.728
Eat and drink your fill.

32:21.960 --> 32:22.720
Good liquor.

32:26.680 --> 32:27.510
See to the guests.

32:27.880 --> 32:29.030
Eat and drink your fill!

32:29.359 --> 32:30.680
Come, eat and drink your fill.

32:36.039 --> 32:36.960
Let me take a look.

32:38.039 --> 32:39.119
Did she break the skin?

32:40.640 --> 32:42.079
Want me to rub it for you?

32:44.519 --> 32:45.400
You only know

32:45.839 --> 32:48.039
how to act fierce around us.

32:48.039 --> 32:50.160
The moment you see your wife,
you turn into a coward.

32:53.920 --> 32:54.559
Jinqi,

32:54.960 --> 32:57.000
you're in for a rough night.

33:02.000 --> 33:03.599
Bitterness first, and sweetness later.

33:04.056 --> 33:05.400
After hardship comes happiness.

33:05.992 --> 33:08.216
Then let's drink to bitterness first,
sweetness later,

33:08.248 --> 33:09.450
and happiness after hardship.

33:09.480 --> 33:09.960
All right.

33:10.519 --> 33:11.200
Everyone,

33:11.519 --> 33:13.799
let's raise a toast
to the groom together.

33:14.079 --> 33:15.440
- Good!
- Good!

33:15.464 --> 33:17.496
- Bitterness first, sweetness later.
- Bitterness first, sweetness later.

33:17.500 --> 33:20.200
- After hardship comes happiness.
- After hardship comes happiness.

33:55.680 --> 33:56.519
Young Madam,

33:56.960 --> 33:59.759
it's really not proper to spend
your wedding night in the side chamber.

34:00.040 --> 34:01.590
You should return to the bedroom.

34:06.079 --> 34:07.200
You both saw

34:07.200 --> 34:08.360
what I did earlier.

34:09.096 --> 34:11.496
It would be even less appropriate
for me to stay there.

34:17.039 --> 34:18.320
I was scared to death.

34:18.360 --> 34:20.664
I was afraid you and Young Master
would start fighting.

34:20.712 --> 34:22.840
I didn't expect
Young Master to be so good-tempered.

34:22.952 --> 34:24.510
He acted as though nothing had happened

34:24.510 --> 34:25.592
and went off to drink.

34:26.000 --> 34:27.400
Mind your manners.

34:27.800 --> 34:28.679
She is Young Madam.

34:33.239 --> 34:34.159
Yes.

34:34.880 --> 34:35.719
Young Madam.

34:44.039 --> 34:45.320
My dear Young Madam,

34:48.880 --> 34:50.159
just sit still.

34:53.440 --> 34:54.800
I know you mean well,

34:55.480 --> 34:57.039
but things are different now.

34:58.559 --> 34:59.719
If anyone sees you doing this,

35:00.039 --> 35:01.239
they'll get scolded.

35:19.920 --> 35:21.440
Are we still friends?

35:42.440 --> 35:43.559
My dear Young Madam,

35:46.840 --> 35:47.639
of course we are.

35:50.760 --> 35:52.239
As long as you don't take my work

35:52.719 --> 35:53.480
away from me.

35:57.639 --> 35:59.000
To be selfish for a moment,

36:00.679 --> 36:03.519
I'm truly happy today.

36:04.239 --> 36:05.000
Back then,

36:05.840 --> 36:07.679
I was driven out of Zhichun Hall

36:07.760 --> 36:09.039
and married off to a fool.

36:11.800 --> 36:12.519
Now,

36:13.440 --> 36:15.920
you're the Young Madam of Zhichun Hall.

36:18.559 --> 36:19.519
From now on,

36:21.000 --> 36:23.390
I won't have to fear that
the new Young Madam will dislike me

36:23.512 --> 36:25.190
and drive me out of Zhichun Hall again.

37:12.008 --> 37:13.440
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

37:15.288 --> 37:16.190
You may all leave.

37:18.880 --> 37:19.360
Let's go.

38:30.559 --> 38:32.159
Before you left Zhichun Hall,

38:33.528 --> 38:35.190
I already had feelings for you.

38:37.920 --> 38:38.559
I know

38:40.072 --> 38:41.672
you don't feel the same way about me.

38:46.400 --> 38:47.880
To become your husband,

38:49.672 --> 38:51.190
I've thought about it for a long time

38:52.480 --> 38:53.440
and done a great deal.

38:56.280 --> 38:57.000
But you

38:59.000 --> 39:00.320
had no time to prepare

39:01.239 --> 39:03.000
before suddenly becoming my wife.

39:07.320 --> 39:08.800
I completely understand

39:08.920 --> 39:10.400
why you're upset and resistant.

39:12.639 --> 39:13.960
If I were in your place

39:15.039 --> 39:17.719
and someone had schemed
and manipulated me like this,

39:19.840 --> 39:21.519
I'd want to kill them, too.

39:38.639 --> 39:39.880
I'll give you time

39:41.199 --> 39:42.400
to accept me.

39:44.639 --> 39:45.639
I'll do everything I can

39:46.840 --> 39:48.280
to make you fall for me, too.

39:51.039 --> 39:51.920
But in this lifetime,

39:53.159 --> 39:53.679
you,

39:54.719 --> 39:55.639
Xu Lanxiang,

39:56.920 --> 39:58.039
can only be

39:59.400 --> 40:00.960
my wife.

40:09.639 --> 40:10.440
Lin Jinqi!

40:11.800 --> 40:12.760
What are you doing?

40:14.400 --> 40:16.239
Put me down, Lin Jinqi!

40:20.039 --> 40:21.119
Lin Jinqi!

40:22.599 --> 40:23.559
What are you doing?

40:23.559 --> 40:26.700
♪I'd spend every dawn
and dusk to see it through♪

40:29.320 --> 40:30.239
Lin Jinqi!

40:33.760 --> 40:34.840
Put me down!

40:37.880 --> 40:39.840
What are you doing? Put me down!

40:45.920 --> 40:46.719
Lin Jinqi!

40:48.072 --> 40:49.320
What are you trying to do?

40:53.519 --> 40:54.400
From this day forward,

40:55.320 --> 40:56.440
we are husband and wife,

40:56.728 --> 40:58.552
and we'll share
both fortune and hardship.

41:00.440 --> 41:01.039
But

41:04.088 --> 41:06.008
you'll enjoy the good fortune first,

41:06.599 --> 41:07.880
and I'll bear the hardship first.

41:09.688 --> 41:11.280
If it becomes more than I can bear,

41:12.648 --> 41:14.328
then there's nothing I can do about it.

41:17.599 --> 41:18.159
Tonight,

41:18.600 --> 41:19.760
you'll sleep in the bedroom.

41:20.296 --> 41:21.630
I'll sleep in the side chamber.

43:05.060 --> 43:07.500
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:10.079 --> 43:11.679
A mother can't control her grown son.

43:12.960 --> 43:15.519
Try to look on the bright side.

43:16.639 --> 43:17.400
Jiugao

43:18.440 --> 43:20.159
just doesn't want to marry.

43:21.000 --> 43:21.719
At least

43:22.190 --> 43:24.584
he hasn't brought some
unreliable person into the family

43:24.632 --> 43:27.320
to stand before you every day
and make your life miserable.

43:27.719 --> 43:28.679
First Madam is busy,

43:30.599 --> 43:31.800
so I won't go in.

43:32.559 --> 43:33.440
I'm fine now.

43:33.960 --> 43:35.239
Don't let it weigh on you.

43:36.360 --> 43:37.079
Don't.

43:37.239 --> 43:38.320
Lanxiang! Lan...

43:38.320 --> 43:38.880
All right.

43:55.020 --> 43:59.140
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:01.980 --> 44:06.500
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:07.780 --> 44:11.700
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:12.380 --> 44:15.140
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:15.860 --> 44:18.180
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:18.180 --> 44:21.260
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:22.780 --> 44:27.020
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:29.940 --> 44:34.100
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:35.900 --> 44:39.460
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:39.460 --> 44:43.020
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:43.820 --> 44:49.500
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:49.860 --> 44:54.180
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:54.540 --> 44:57.500
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:57.500 --> 45:01.260
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:01.260 --> 45:04.140
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:04.140 --> 45:08.220
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:08.220 --> 45:11.580
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:11.580 --> 45:15.340
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:15.340 --> 45:19.340
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:20.100 --> 45:24.260
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:24.260 --> 45:27.700
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:27.700 --> 45:31.340
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:31.340 --> 45:34.220
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:34.220 --> 45:38.300
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:38.300 --> 45:41.660
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:41.660 --> 45:45.300
♪Let beginnings fade
